    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νουμήν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Att.
		
		
			contr.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεομήνιος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>used at the new moon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτοι</span>”
